' Rejected: more than one `start` in a diagram.
' A process diagram has exactly one entry point. Multiple starts
' break the Scenarios tab (which path is "the" first?) and suggest
' two processes that should be separate diagrams.
' Rewrite: keep one `start`. If the process legitimately begins in
' different ways depending on trigger, encode that as the first
' branch after `start`.
@startuml
start
:第 1 プロセス;
stop

start
:第 2 プロセス;
stop
@enduml
